WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:08.333
Your child reads ten words. Some have a silent e, and some do not. They are in a new order.

3
00:00:08.783 --> 00:00:12.440
There are no marks under the words today. Do not help on this page.

4
00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:14.948
Mark each word read right, and count.

5
00:00:15.398 --> 00:00:17.273
Eight or more, go on to day six.

6
00:00:17.723 --> 00:00:23.378
Fewer than eight, do days two, three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

7
00:00:23.828 --> 00:00:28.383
Then play the game on the next page. Your child reads each stone, and colors it.

8
00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:33.713
A stone with a silent e is colored yellow. A stone with no e is colored blue.
